"""NORA Entity-Context v5.4 — coverage-first multi-resolution discovery with precision entity/context/relation structure.

Design constraints:
- No external/pretrained language model downloads.
- No Hugging Face/SentenceTransformer/GLiNER/BGE dependency.
- Train-only classical/statistical representations and locally learned
  distributional semantics.
- Multi-resolution semantic discovery is primary: macro + fine semantic partitions.
- Coverage-first fine partitioning assigns every clusterable customer problem; confidence is reported instead of silently discarding usable interactions.
- Non-semantic lenses discover workflow/context, entity-configuration, and relation-motif structure independently of semantic wording.
- Precision-calibrated entity acceptance, context/RCA/remediation extraction, ontology alignment and typed relation-graph exports from v5.3 are retained.
- No BERT/Transformer/pretrained embedding weights are downloaded or required.
"""
